        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 89.2b" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="605" ed="#liebermann"/>Si uero non compareat carta, set ab illo qui inseruire uult disfacta<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.8"/> sit, weregildu[m<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.9"/>] eius componat, duas partes illi qu[em<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="10" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.10"/>] inseruire uoluerit, terciam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.11"/> regi, et iterum per preceptum regis libertatem ipsam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.12"/> componat<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="13" target="#Hn_89-2b.lnote.oe.13"/>.</ab>
